  "quiz": {
    "question": "给定 int val = 5; int *p = &val; int **pp = &p; 以下哪个不能读取 val 的值？",
    "options": [
      "val",
      "*p",
      "**pp",
      "&p"
    ],
    "correctIndex": 3,
    "explanation": "&p 是指针 p 的地址（pp 的值），所以不是 5。\nval == *p == **pp。"
  },
